     "textwithimage": {
      "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
      "fileReference": "/content/dam/macnicaglobal2/americas/mai/en/products/boards-modules/hitek-systems/Agilex eSOM7-2F.jpg",
      "imageRatio": "40",
      "alt": "Agilex eSOM7-2F",
      "text": "<p>Altera 10nm Agilex 7 Series FPGA based embedded SOM (eSOM™) module for embedded, edge processing, wireless communication and networking-centric designs. Up to 1.2Tbps high speed transceivers bandwidth supporting up to 58Gbps PAM4 and x16 PCIe Gen 4 interfaces. Integrated quad-core 64-bit A53 ARM processor complex with network, control and storage peripherals.</p>",
      "displayPopupTitle": "true",
      "linkTarget": "_self",
      "titleValueFromDAM": "true",
      "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/textwithimage",
      "isDecorative": "false",
      "textIsRich": "true",
      "altValueFromDAM": "false",
      "cq:styleIds": [
       "1718154328384",
       "",
       ""
      ],
      "spImage": {
       "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
       "fileReference": "/content/dam/macnicaglobal2/americas/mai/en/products/boards-modules/hitek-systems/Agilex eSOM7-2F.jpg",
       "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/image"
      }
     }
    },
    "container_747566298": {
     "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
     "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/container",
     "backgroundColor": "#f0f0f0",
     "cq:styleIds": [
      "1717498052331",
      "1717498053499"
     ],
     "text": {
      "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
      "text": "<h3>Features of the Agilex 7 FPGA based eSOM</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Aglilex 7 F-series 24C package FPGA with 2x F-tiles</li>\r\n<li>Supported FPGAs: 027/022 and 014/012</li>\r\n<li>Onboard FPGA fabric memory: 2banks of 72-bit 4/8GB DDR4 memories, 2GB SDM QSPI for FPGA image</li>\r\n<li>On board HPS memory: 72-bit 4/8GB component DDR4 memory, 16/32GB eMMC and μSD card debug slot</li>\r\n<li>Two 400-pin connectors<ul>\r\n<li>Primary Connector (J1)<ul>\r\n<li>F-Tile based Serdes interface; 16 NRZ (32Gbps) or 12 PAM4 (58.125Gbps) transceivers</li>\r\n<li>HPS Interfaces: Ethernet (1000Base-T/MDI), USB 2.0 host, UART, I2C and SPI</li>\r\n<li>BMC Interfaces: UART, I2C, board control I/O</li>\r\n<li>Single +12V power input the module</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>Secondary Connector (J2)<ul>\r\n<li>F-Tile based Serdes interface; 16 NRZ (32Gbps) or 12 PAM4 (58.125Gbps) transceivers</li>\r\n<li>Fabric side true-differential (LVDS), 1.2V differential, 1.2V single-ended GPIO for control, interface and clock management</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>Debug support: FPGA JTAG access, console access to HPS, UART and I2C interfaces to BMC FPGA, extensive temperature and voltage sensors for board telemetry</li>\r\n<li>Up to 120A core rail supply using multi-phase controller and DrMOS power stages</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n",
      "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/text",
      "textIsRich": "true"
     }
    },
    "container_2142884278": {
     "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
     "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/container",
     "backgroundColor": "#f7f7f7",
     "cq:styleIds": [
      "1717498052331",
      "1717498053499"
     ],
     "text": {
      "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
      "text": "<h3>BSP and Design Support</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Complete Linux BSP support package</li>\r\n<li>Comprehensive APIs for board management</li>\r\n<li>Quartus reference projects</li>\r\n<li>Carrier boards design guide for custom carrier designs</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h3>Target Markets</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>5G/ORAN and SATCOM wireless systems</li>\r\n<li>Embedded high performance edge AI/ML systems</li>\r\n<li>Signal processing and image processing</li>\r\n<li>400/200G/100G/50G/40G/25G/10G networked signal processing devices and platforms</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n",
      "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/text",
      "textIsRich": "true"
     }
    },
